== Notes ==
* {{dlc|a}} This trinket can be found by destroying {{E|Special Shopkeeper|n}}s.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Humbleing Bundle|nr}}: All {{e|Key}}s spawned by the trinket become {{e|Key Ring}}s.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{i|Humbleing Bundle}}: All normal {{e|Key}}s spawned by the trinket get a 50% chance to turn into {{e|Key Ring}}s.{{dlc-}}
* {{C|Tainted Keeper}}: The trinket works with the temporary coins spawned from defeating enemies, effectively turning it into an infinite {{e|Key}} generator.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Increases the chances to:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.5<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
